            "content": "\n# i'm tobi, nice to meet you! ☺️\n\n![tobias hinderling at workplace](tobi_workplace.webp)\n\nI am a passionate frontend developer and UX/UI designer with a flair for pragmatic solutions.\n\n> My motto: KISS - Keep it Simple Stupid\n\nI try to develop lean, maintenance-free solutions whenever possible.\n\nI use AI - but only where it makes sense!\n"
          },
          "de": {
            "frontmatter": {
              "name": [
                "Tobias Hinderling"
              ],
              "skills": [
                "web-design",
                "web-development",
                "ux-design",
                "ai-automation"
              ],
              "social-skills": [
                "pragmatic",
                "keep it simple",
                "direct communication",
                "coffee drinking ☕️"
              ]
            },
            "content": "\n# i bi dr tobi, freut mi di kennezlehre! ☺️\n\n![tobias hinderling am arbeitsplatz](tobi_workplace.webp)\n\nIch bin passionierter Frontend-Entwickler und UX/UI-Designer mit einem Flair für pragmatische Lösungen.\n\n> Mein Motto: KISS - Keep it Simple Stupid\n\nIch versuche möglichst schlanke, wartungsfreie Lösungen zu erarbeiten.\n\nDabei setze ich auf AI - aber nur wo es Sinn ergibt!\n"
          }
        }
