            },
            "content": "\n# many interests, both indoors and outdoors! ☺️\n\n## Indoor\n\nWhen I'm not working, I still sometimes sit at the computer and nerd around a bit, e.g. by trying out a new Linux distribution...\n\nOr migrating my data bit by bit from the US cloud to Europe to regain control over my data...\n\nSometimes I also develop a tool, or a website like this one.\n\nSometimes with, sometimes without AI, just as I feel like.\n\n## Outdoor\n\nWhen the weather is nice, I am drawn outside, e.g. to a summit in Switzerland. Whether summer or winter, it doesn't matter.\n\n![alt text](<Schneeweekend Collage.jpg>)\n\nWater is absolutely my element. Whether frozen with skis or liquid with a kayak, I just feel comfortable there!\n"
          },
