        "translations": {
          "en": {
            "frontmatter": {
              "tags": [
                "concept",
                "design",
                "illustration",
                "development"
              ],
              "technologies / tools": [
                "figma",
                "affinity designer",
                "kirby cms"
              ],
              "year": [
                2025
              ],
              "link": "https://www.openairambielersee.ch",
              "cta": {
                "text": "the website in full splendor!",
                "button": "I want to see that!",
                "link": "https://www.openairambielersee.ch"
              }
            },
            "content": "\n# Openair am Bielersee\n\nThe somewhat different website - for the somewhat different openair festival.\n\nThe Openair am Bielersee is deliberately different:\n\n- Stage made of wood\n- Actually everything made of wood\n- No sponsors\n- Family atmosphere\n\nFor over 30 years, this somewhat different openair has thrilled its visitors and is regularly sold out.\n\nWe wanted to implement this spirit as a website. Thus the idea was born to give the website a stage.\n\n![homepage openair am bielersee](openair_am_bielersee.png)\n\nThis is what the openair looks like in real life!\n\n![Openair at night](openair_nacht.jpg)\n"
          },
          "de": {
            "frontmatter": {
              "tags": [
                "concept",
                "design",
                "illustration",
                "development"
              ],
              "technologies / tools": [
                "figma",
                "affinity designer",
                "kirby cms"
              ],
              "year": [
                2025
              ],
              "link": "https://www.openairambielersee.ch",
              "cta": {
                "text": "d website i vouer pracht!",
                "button": "das wotti gseh!",
                "link": "https://www.openairambielersee.ch"
              }
            },
            "content": "\n# Openair am Bielersee\n\nDie etwas andere Webseite - für das etwas andere Openair.\n\nDas Openair am Bielersee ist bewusst anders:\n\n- Bühne aus Holze\n- Eigentlich alles aus Holz\n- Keine Sponsoren\n- Familiäre Atmosphäre\n\nSeit über 30 Jahren begeistert das etas ander Openair seine besucher und ist regelmässig Ausverkauft.\n\nDiesen Spirit wollten wir als Webseite umsetzen. So entstand die Idee, der Webseite eine Bühne zu geben.\n\n![startseite openair am bielersee](openair_am_bielersee.png)\n\nSo sieht das Openair in echt aus!\n\n![Openair bei Nacht](openair_nacht.jpg)\n"
          }
        }
